Every opioid-pain-clinical-practice-guideline is a voluntary-guideline.
Every opioid-pain-clinical-practice-guideline is a recommendation-only-guideline.
Every opioid-pain-clinical-practice-guideline should support a clinical-judgment.
If there is an opioid-pain-clinical-practice-guideline then it is recommended that the opioid-pain-clinical-practice-guideline does not supplant a clinical-judgment.
Every opioid-pain-clinical-practice-guideline should support an individualized-person-centered-decision.
If there is an opioid-pain-clinical-practice-guideline then it is recommended that the opioid-pain-clinical-practice-guideline does not supplant an individualized-person-centered-decision.
